@startuml
[*] --> Running : Restart Command

Running --> Configuration Mode : Changes or Power-Saving Settings Required
Configuration Mode --> Running : Configuration is Completed
Running --> Running : Clock Trigger (Data Collection)
Running --> Controlled Mode : Remote Control Command
Running --> Shut Down : Shutdown Command
Controlled Mode --> Running : Any Event (Assumed for completeness)

Shut Down --> [*] : Shutdown Command

@enduml
